# The stub issuer's image (stack/containers/oidc/Dockerfile) needs stack/stub_oidc/ and nothing
# else; without this file `docker build .` shipped the whole checkout -- 21 GB of run bundles
# under runs/ -- as the build context, and filled the disk (2026-09-10). Everything below is
# either generated, a virtualenv, or evidence that lives on the founder's Mac only.
runs/
.venv/
.git/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
specs/
